				{
					"id": 4540603,
					"content": "就像之前，这小子说的。外来的狼群破坏了这里的规矩。它们必然会被制裁。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						4540604
					],
					"speakerTitle": "玻瑞亚斯"
				},
				{
					"id": 4540604,
					"content": "但是你——雷泽，你不准参与讨伐。因为这是狼的问题。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						4540605
					],
					"speakerTitle": "玻瑞亚斯"
				},
				{
					"id": 4540605,
					"content": "你使用钢铁而不是爪牙，驾驭雷电而不是利齿…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						4540606
					],
					"speakerTitle": "玻瑞亚斯"
				},
				{
					"id": 4540606,
					"content": "你属于人类。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						4540607
					],
					"speakerTitle": "玻瑞亚斯"
				},
				{
					"id": 4540607,
					"content": "我和他们，不一样！我才不属于他们！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						4540608
					],
					"speakerTitle": "雷泽"
				},
				{
					"id": 4540608,
					"content": "你…不是狼。这是狼之间的事情。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						4540609
					],
					"speakerTitle": "玻瑞亚斯"
				},
				{
					"id": 4540609,
					"content": "倒是你，雷泽在人类中的卢皮卡。你倒是高尚又特殊之人。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						4540610
					],
					"speakerTitle": "玻瑞亚斯"
				},
				{
					"id": 4540610,
					"content": "如果有心，可以向我来寻求试炼。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						4540611
					],
					"speakerTitle": "玻瑞亚斯"
				},
				{
					"id": 4540611,
					"content": "我言尽于此，有缘再见吧，雷泽，和陌生的人类…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						4540612
					],
					"speakerTitle": "玻瑞亚斯"
				},
				{
					"id": 4540612,
					"content": "唔…雷泽，别露出那种表情嘛。对了！要不要去城内住几天？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						4540613
					],
					"speakerTitle": "安柏"
				},
				{
					"id": 4540613,
					"content": "对啊，你在蒙德城也有一个朋友，不是吗？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						4540614
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 4540614,
					"content": "那个「红色的、很烫的，女孩子」…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						4540615
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 4540615,
					"content": "现在野外的行人对你也很危险。我知道你不想伤害他们。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						4540616
					],
					"speakerTitle": "安柏"
				},
				{
					"id": 4540616,
					"content": "我没事，你们，放心。 但我不属于城市…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						4540617
					],
					"speakerTitle": "雷泽"
				},
				{
					"id": 4540617,
					"content": "我，也不属于这里…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						4540618,
						4540619
					],
					"speakerTitle": "雷泽"
				},
				{
					"id": 4540618,
					"content": "雷泽…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						4540621
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 4540621,
					"content": "#谢谢你们。{NICKNAME}，派蒙，还有……另一个红色的女孩。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						4540622
					],
					"speakerTitle": "雷泽"
				},
				{
					"id": 4540622,
					"content": "我陪你聊了那么久，你居然不记得我叫安柏——？！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						4540623
					],
					"speakerTitle": "安柏"
				},
				{
					"id": 4540623,
					"content": "那么，再见了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "雷泽"
				},
				{
					"id": 4540619,
					"content": "不要太消沉了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						4540621
					]
				}
			]
		},
		{
